      "name": "Boiling Blood",
      "actions": -1,
      "traits": [
        "fire"
      ],
      "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> The dragon is critically hit with a melee attack</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The dragon's superheated blood spills onto the attacker. The target takes 8d6 Fire Damage damage (Basic DC 34 Reflex Saving Throw save).</p>",
