    {
      "name": "Pyre Breath",
      "actions": 2,
      "traits": [
        "fire",
        "primal"
      ],
      "description": "<p>The dragon breathes a blast of flame that deals 13d6 Fire Damage damage in a 50ft Type:cone (Basic DC 34 Reflex Saving Throw save). Creatures that critically fail their save catch fire, taking 2d6 Persistent,fire Damage damage. The area then fills with black smoke for 1 minute. This has the effects of mist, except it fills the cone's area. The dragon can't use Pyre Breath again for 1d4 rounds.</p>",
